From: Timur Ravilov <93673987+t0b1kent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:46:23 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 35/46] EXPERIMENT (not for publication): x87 early FCW check
 and conditional FPSR restore (Astra HB_WV4 package, prepare.py --parts
 early,fpsr)

MACRUNNER_HB_X87_EARLY_FCW=1: new IR op HBX87FastCW takes the FCW itself; PC64 is
rejected (AND/EOR/CBZ) before any operand extraction/classification.
MACRUNNER_HB_X87_CONDITIONAL_FPSR=1: the original FPSR is restored only if the probe
operation changed it (mrs/eor/cbz around the msr). Both gates default off; with both
off the old path is emitted (the accepted restore lambda keeps the plain msr).
Generated by HB_WV4/tools/prepare.py 29.09 with no anchor changes on this tree.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
